<title>SINGAPORE: Hicom tenders S$84 mln for property.</title>
<headline>Hicom tenders S$84 mln for property.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's Hicom Properties Sdn Bhd, part of Hicom Holdings Bhd, has tendered the highest bid of Singapore $84 million for a site in the centre of Singapore, said the Urban Redevelopment Authority (URA) on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>The URA said there were two bids for the 6,332 sq metre site at the Serangoon Road/Sungei Road junction which can be developed into either commercial and or residential developments.</p>
<p>Hicom is a diversified conglomerate with interest ranging from manufacturing automotive parts to real estate development.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
